{
  "slug": "sap-tcd",
  "name": "Sap Tcd",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "SAP transaction automation for business processes: Business Partner (BP), Material Master (MM01), and Sales Order (VA01) management. Companion to sap-dev-core (install that first — its shared scripts are required at runtime).",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `sap-bp` (Manages SAP Business Partners via the BP transaction using SAP GUI Scripting), `sap-mm01` (Manages SAP material masters via MM01/MM02/MM03 using SAP GUI Scripting), `sap-va01` (Manages SAP sales orders via VA01/VA02/VA03 using SAP GUI Scripting)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install sap-tcd@claude-community` from `sapdev-ai/sap-dev` (`plugins/sap-tcd`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
